<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Вступление:<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
